    "body": "## Summary\n\nFifth same-day re-dispatch of W1-T254. As with the four prior closures (PR #1007, #1012,\n#1013, #1015), this task is already satisfied on `main`: PR #720 (commit `15a2168`, still an\nancestor of this branch's HEAD) shipped the light-sweep ticker, outcome-keyed post-review dedup,\nper-PR throw containment, and attempt ledgering this task asks for, and its body carries the\n`Remudero-Task: W1-T254` trailer.\n\nThis PR makes **no functional code change** — only a `DECISIONS.md` entry recording the closure,\nper the established precedent for this task.\n\n## Acceptance criteria — how the already-merged code satisfies each\n\n1. **\"post-review dedup is outcome-keyed — a prior acted:true dispose with no posted/refused\n   verdict for that head still retries; a refusal for the head dedups\"**\n   `src/lib/sweep.ts`'s `priorActionsFromLedger` derives `postReviewed` from\n   `review.posted`/`review.post_refused` ledger lines, never from `sweep.disposed acted:true`.\n   Proof: `npx vitest run test/sweep.test.ts` → 130 tests, 0 failures, including the subtest\n   `\"runSweep: post-review dedup is outcome-keyed — a prior acted:true dispose with no\n   posted/refused verdict for that head still retries; a refusal for the head dedups (W1-T254)\"`\n   (test/sweep.test.ts:1873), which passes.\n\n2. **\"a thrown action does not abort the rest of the sweep pass — later PRs still reconcile and\n   the throwing PR is attributed\"**\n   The action switch in `runSweep` is wrapped per-PR in try/catch: on throw, `acted=false` plus an\n   `action_error` field is appended, and the loop continues to the next PR. Proof:\n   `npx vitest run test/sweep.test.ts` → same 130/0 run, including the subtest `\"runSweep: a\n   throwing action does not abort the pass — later PRs still reconcile and the throwing PR is\n   attributed (W1-T254)\"` (test/sweep.test.ts:2101), which passes.\n\n3. **\"the light-sweep ticker runs post-review while runOne is in flight, so a green PR with an\n   absent review re-posts within one poll interval\"**\n   `src/lib/daemon.ts`'s `runDaemon` starts an injected-clock interval (`DaemonDeps.sweepLight`)\n   around the `runOne` call; `src/run-task.ts` wires `buildSweepLightHook` with\n   `actionable: (d) => d === \"post-review\"`. Proof: `npx vitest run test/daemon.test.ts` → 86\n   tests, 0 failures, including the subtest `\"W1-T254: the light sweep runs while runOne is in\n   flight, so a green PR with an absent review re-posts within one poll interval (the #707 fix)\"`\n   (test/daemon.test.ts:1883), which passes.\n\n4. **\"every post-review attempt and its outcome are ledgered, and a dry-run dispose line is\n   tagged so it is never misread as a daemon action\"**\n   `buildSweepEffects.postReview` logs `sweep.post_review.attempt` before `reviewCommand`, then\n   `sweep.post_review.done`/`.failed`. Proof: `grep -n \"sweep.post_review.attempt\"\n   src/run-task.ts` → `src/run-task.ts:8233`, present and unchanged.\n\nAlso re-verified: `git merge-base --is-ancestor 15a2168 HEAD` → true (PR #720 is still an\nancestor of this branch).\n\n## Follow-ups\n\n- task: `src/lib/drain.ts`'s `isDispatchEligible` (lines 123-125) already calls `isMerged(t.id)`\n  and short-circuits before dispatch, and `src/lib/status.ts`'s trailer rung (line 1016) already\n  credits PR #720's `Remudero-Task: W1-T254` trailer — so this repo's own dispatch-eligibility\n  path should already exclude W1-T254. Yet this is the fifth same-day re-dispatch on top of a HEAD\n  containing all four prior no-op closures. Whatever is issuing these dispatches is either not\n  going through `nextRunnable`/`isDispatchEligible`, or is consulting a stale/uncached merged-set.\n  Worth a dedicated investigation into the outer dispatcher (separate from this repo's own\n  drain/status logic, which appears correct) — five full worker sessions (worktree + `npm ci` +\n  test run + PR) have now been spent reconfirming an unchanged fact.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `npx vitest run test/sweep.test.ts` → 130 tests, 0 failures\n- [x] `npx vitest run test/daemon.test.ts` → 86 tests, 0 failures\n- [x] `grep -n \"sweep.post_review.attempt\" src/run-task.ts` → `src/run-task.ts:8233`\n- [x] `git merge-base --is-ancestor 15a2168 HEAD` → true\n\nRemudero-Task: W1-T254\n",
